### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 88/100.** Agents' Last Exam 59.3%, OSWorld 72.6%, ScreenSpot-Pro 92.7% show strong computer-use; Terminal-Bench 4.0 57.9% and AutomationBench 41.4% cap the score. No independent Tau3/GDPval public numbers.
- **Reasoning: 96/100.** GPQA Diamond 96.0%, FrontierMath Tier 4 97.6%, ARC-AGI-3 99.9% place at frontier; HLE w/ tools 57.2% and Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 53 limit the ceiling.
- **Context window: 98/100.** 1.05M window with MRCR 100% at 256K-512K and 96.3% at 512K-1M. Slightly below 98% top-range retrieval caps at 98.
- **Multimodal: 65/100.** Text + image in, text out. No video/audio input.
- **Coding: 88/100.** DeepSWE 74.1% reaches frontier threshold; FrontierCode 64.5% / 53.3% and Terminal-Bench 4.0 57.9% keep score below top tier.
- **Cost efficiency: 30/100.** $10/$50 per 1M input/output = ~30 per methodology.
- **Overall Score: 87/100.** Mean of Tool 88 + Reasoning 96 + Context 98 + Multimodal 65 + Coding 88 = 87. Best fit for high-stakes frontier reasoning and computer-use where cost is secondary.

